## Summary

Implement the Copilot repair packet generator and renderer: map ACTION_PLAN implementer-role items to a schema-valid CopilotRepairPacket and render the existing Jinja2 template to a file artifact only; preserve copilot_authority=implementer-only and mutation_performed=false pins; no GitHub posting.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not post to GitHub or add comments. Do not enable Copilot cloud-agent features. Do not include supervisor-role or ci-role categories in the packet.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

